doc: A busy repo reports on every overview row, and scenes switch the lower zone
given busy
when keys 1
then scene = work
then overview = Sync=↑2 ↓1 vs origin/feat/login Files=1 staged · 3 unstaged Peers=none Stashes=4 Notes=doing.md Template=v0.9.1 → v0.10.0 PRs=#42 Add login flow
when keys 2
then scene = review
when keys 3
then scene = sync
when keys 4
then scene = maintain
when keys 1
then scene = work
